  "scenario": "scenario-to-plugin",
  "description": "Experience contract for Scenario to Plugin. The product is a release console, and its organizing object is the gate ladder — composition, conformance, attestation, rehearsal, publication. Every page either shows a position on that ladder or explains one rung. Product pages are `draft` and every claim is `aspirational` because no route is built yet; elements and bindings are declared so claims can be promoted to machine tier without rewriting page intent. Two honesty properties are load-bearing and appear as claims on several pages: a gate never renders green from an absent check, and a stage that was never judged is never rendered as a failure.",
